+---
+id: task-002-add-rental-availability-query
+type: task
+title: "Add rental availability query"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Add `availability({ start, end, kind? })` to the rental service. It returns the sorted equipment IDs whose kind matches the optional filter and which have no booking overlapping the full exclusive-end UTC period. Validate the period using the service's existing UTC-midnight rules. Document the API and implement it alongside the existing in-memory equipment and bookings.
